## Excitation Signal

A small torque dither layered on top of the impedance controller:

    τ_cmd = Î·θ̈_d + μ̂·sign(θ̇) + Kp·e + Kd·ė + A_τ·sin(2πft)

Parameters used: A_τ = 2.5 N·m, f = 2.0 Hz
The task stays monotonic (door opens smoothly), zero velocity reversals.

