## RLS Update Equations

Kalman gain:    K_k = P_{k-1}·φ_k / (λ + φ_k^T·P_{k-1}·φ_k)
Parameter update: π̂_k = π̂_{k-1} + K_k·(τ_k - φ_k^T·π̂_{k-1})
Covariance update: P_k = (1/λ)·(P_{k-1} - K_k·φ_k^T·P_{k-1})

Initialization: π̂_0 = [5.0, 3.0]^T, P_0 = 1000·I_{2×2}
Forgetting factor: λ = 0.995 → effective memory window ≈ 0.4s

